  "notes": [
    "Measured values are float32 input registers (FC04); the same values are also holding registers at the same address (FC03).",
    "Energies are given here without a unit because the interface definition does not state it; the integer energies (0x0320 onwards) are 32-bit unsigned.",
    "Parameters V1-V3 are L-N voltages on 3P4W and L-L voltages on 3P3W.",
    "Not in this map: the values updated at the user update rate, the power-down time stamps, timers and the individual harmonics (0x0190 onwards)."
  ],
